# Server runtime state (real player balances, admin-tuned settings, the in-progress hand log).
# The server writes these relative to its working directory: packages/server/ under
# `npm run dev/start --workspace=...`, or wherever the PLAYER_STORE_PATH / GAME_CONFIG_PATH /
# HAND_LOG_PATH overrides point. The `.tmp` files are the atomic-write scratch copies.
